# Cesium ion access tokens for the satellite imagery on the Live page's threat map, comma-separated. The globe uses
# them in turn: when one stops answering or its account runs out of credit, the next takes over; with none, or
# offline, the bundled Natural Earth II tiles serve. Put real tokens in frontend/.env.local (git-ignored), never here.
VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKENS=
